<title>CANADA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts Agrium EPS view.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts Agrium EPS view.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said analyst Doug Groh reduced his earnings estimate for Agrium Inc to US$0.18 per share from US$0.37 for the fourth quarter, and to US$1.95 from US$2.20 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- Maintained ratings of near-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell one to $14 on the Big Board.</p>
</text>
